1
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,600
Where is that shameless daughter-in-law?

2
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:10,400
Thotsaphon and I searched every room,

3
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,200
but we couldn't find Hathai anywhere.

4
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,440
Unless...

5
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:17,920
I mean, I'm not sure if Hathai...

6
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,399
Where do you think she is?

7
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,800
I think Hathai might be
sleeping with Dech.

8
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,280
She would never do such a thing.

9
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,840
You're slandering my wife.

10
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:35,680
I've heard the servants gossiping
about this for a long time,

11
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,400
but I never said anything

12
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,800
because I didn't want
to cause problems in your family.

13
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,880
But today, Hathai disappeared with Dech.

14
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,440
That's why I called Father.

15
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:49,440
I didn't want your wife to bring
any more disgrace on the family.

16
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:53,560
You said the servants were gossiping,
but you've never seen anything.

17
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,760
You can't just repeat
whatever other people say.

18
00:04:57,840 --> 00:05:00,240
I know you resent

19
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,080
being only the second daughter-in-law

20
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:06,440
because Hathai holds
all the authority in this house.

21
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,280
That's why you want to get rid of her.

22
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:13,440
If you think I made all of this up
to frame Hathai,

23
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:17,960
then I'll take responsibility,
and I'll be the one to leave this house.

24
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:23,480
Everyone, please calm down.
This could all be a misunderstanding.

25
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,600
Father,

26
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,920
I'll go check Dech's room myself.

27
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:31,720
No. I'll see it with my own eyes.

28
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:36,120
If that shameless in-law has done
something filthy under my roof,

29
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,800
I won't keep her here either.

30
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:59,280
Ann, your mistress

31
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,520
is getting thrown
out of the mansion today.

32
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,480
She'll end up like a stray dog
on the street.

33
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,400
Father!

34
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,440
You shameless woman!

35
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,720
Do you realize what you've done?!

36
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,880
- Sir--
- You bastard!

37
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:05,680
- Sir, please.
- You bite the hand that feeds you!

38
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:07,720
You--

39
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,760
Burapha, calm down! Please, calm down!

40
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:12,560
If you kill him,
you'll have to pay for it too.

41
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,280
Who's going to take care of your kid?

42
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:18,320
I'm sorry, sir. I was wrong.

43
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,720
Dech.

44
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:24,080
Pack your things and get out
of my house right now,

45
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,760
before I kill you.

46
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,280
Calm down, bro.

47
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,760
Get dressed and come see me.

48
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:49,440
Burapha, please.
Please listen to me first.

49
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:53,080
Please, listen to me. Please!

50
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,080
Hathai.

51
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,800
I understand.

52
00:07:57,880 --> 00:08:00,600
Desire is hard to control.

53
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,840
You could've gotten yourself
a room at a luxurious

54
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:05,680
five-star hotel. You should've
chosen somewhere

55
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:08,000
befitting the dignity
of the eldest daughter-in-law.

56
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,760
Instead, you did it in a worker's room.

57
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:13,680
You've made yourself look like

58
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:15,960
a street prostitute.

59
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,880
Where is that slut?

60
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,120
Drag her in here right now!

61
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,440
Hathai,

62
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,960
how did things come to this?

63
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,559
Was I not good enough to you?

64
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,760
Tell me.

65
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:46,680
You've treated me well in every way.

66
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:51,840
Better than any husband
could treat his wife.

67
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,880
Then why did you sleep with him?

68
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,120
Did Dech drug you?

69
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,720
Did he force himself on you?

70
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:03,080
I'll call the police myself.

71
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,680
There's no need.

72
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:10,120
I slept with Dech willingly.

73
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,160
This wasn't the first time, right?

74
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,480
I'm sorry.

75
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:35,480
I'm so sorry. I truly am.

76
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:37,960
Why?

77
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,800
Why would you do this to me?

78
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,520
I'm sorry.

79
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:46,960
I'm so sorry.

80
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,240
Well, Burapha?

81
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,040
Have your eyes finally opened?

82
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:56,880
Now do you understand why I told you
not to marry a restaurant hostess?

83
00:09:58,440 --> 00:10:01,960
The moment I saw you, I knew exactly
what kind of woman you were.

84
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:05,600
You got yourself pregnant on purpose
so you could trap my son.

85
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:09,960
I let you live in this house because
I love my son and my granddaughter.

86
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,640
They are my own blood.

87
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,840
And now you've finally
shown your true colors.

88
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:18,080
You're an unfaithful wife who has
humiliated her husband.

89
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:22,640
Aren't you even going to ask me

90
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,800
why I became this way?

91
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,600
Because you really are a parasite.

92
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,920
You only care about living comfortably.
You don't want to work.

93
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,280
Every day of your life,
you live off others.

94
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,560
You latch onto people
like a parasite clinging to a tree,

95
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:36,200
sucking away their money.

96
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,920
How many millions
has my son spent on you already?

97
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:42,240
Luckily, we caught you
before you could drain him dry.

98
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,720
Your time is up.

99
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,920
Get out of my house, you parasite!

100
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,680
I've always known

101
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,480
ever since I came to live in this house,

102
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:56,080
one day I'd be thrown out.

103
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,480
But I want you to know something.

104
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,800
The reason my family
fell apart is because of you.

105
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:05,400
Don't you dare blame me.

106
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:09,040
Ever since I moved into this house,

107
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:14,920
all you've ever done is look
for reasons to accuse me.

108
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,800
You were always convinced
I would cheat on him.

109
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:19,040
And was I wrong?

110
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,720
No woman wants to be

111
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:25,360
branded an adulteress. No woman
wants to be treated like a loose woman.

112
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,160
I know

113
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:31,360
you hate women who work in nightlife.

114
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:35,600
But I tried to behave well in every way.

115
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,920
I wanted everyone to love me.

116
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,800
Yet you were prejudiced against me because

117
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:44,440
you believed someone beneath you could
only come here to take advantage of you.

118
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:48,280
No matter how good I tried to be,

119
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:51,960
you never once opened
your heart to accept me.

120
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,520
That's why

121
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:56,160
you did everything you could

122
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:59,000
to keep me away from Burapha.

123
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:04,200
You sent him to work

124
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:07,120
on a housing development project
in another province.

125
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:10,280
All the while, you kept looking
for another woman

126
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,520
to replace me as your daughter-in-law.

127
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:16,640
Just like today, when he went to dinner

128
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,560
with the gold shop owner's daughter.

129
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:20,680
Do you think I'm stupid?

130
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,520
How did you know about that?

131
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,080
Because of her!

132
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,720
Your second daughter-in-law.

133
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,040
She runs her own personal news agency,

134
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:32,680
reporting everything to me

135
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:34,680
just so I'll die of heartbreak.

136
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:38,240
Everyone in this house hates me.

137
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:40,120
You all want me gone.

138
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,640
That's not true, Hathai.

139
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:48,760
I've always been on your side.

140
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:51,440
I'm a daughter-in-law too.

141
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:53,040
We're in the same position.

142
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:55,280
We're family.

143
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,200
You lying bitch!

144
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,160
You're the worst one of all.

145
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:02,000
You think you're special
because Father hand-picked you,

146
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:04,600
so you kiss up to him
every chance you get.

147
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,640
But Father

148
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:10,880
loves my daughter more than yours,

149
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,600
and that eats you alive.

150
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:16,280
You're scared she'll get everything.
That's why you've been backstabbing me.

151
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,280
Father.

152
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:22,760
I've never thought anything like that.

153
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:26,440
Hathai is slandering me.

154
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:30,520
You want to prove it?
Come swear at nine temples with me.

155
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,440
Whoever is lying,

156
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:35,440
may they die a horrible death
and never be reborn.

157
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,720
Enough! That's enough!

158
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:41,880
Get out of my house.
I'm sick of looking at you.

159
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:44,200
I'm leaving, Father.

160
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:45,720
I'm sick and tired

161
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:48,680
of letting everyone call me a parasite.

162
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:56,640
But I'm not leaving alone.

163
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:01,720
I'm taking my daughter with me.

164
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,200
No!

165
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:06,480
You can't take Hathaya. She stays with me.

166
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:08,160
Have you forgotten

167
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:10,760
that you prevented Burapha and me

168
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:12,880
from legally registering our marriage?

169
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:15,480
You have no right
to demand anything from me.

170
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:21,800
Hathaya is the only thing I have left.

171
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:24,680
I will not let my daughter

172
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:27,360
stay with someone as narrow-minded as you.

173
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,960
Where is Hathaya?

174
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:33,680
Don't let her take Hathaya!

175
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:35,920
Hathaya!

176
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:45,200
Done! This is Hathaya's castle.

177
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:47,200
Daddy, Mommy, and I

178
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,920
all live together in our happy castle.

179
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:54,480
Your castle is so pretty.
I'll make a flower garden for you.

180
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:58,480
I'm sorry.

181
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:02,240
It's okay. If it falls down,
we can build it again.

182
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,560
I'll go ask Daddy to help us.

183
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,800
Hathaya.

184
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,720
Come with Aunt Liu.

185
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:31,240
Hathaya. Hathaya.

186
00:15:31,760 --> 00:15:34,280
Hathaya. Hathaya, where are you?

187
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:38,640
Hathaya! Can you hear Mommy, sweetheart?

188
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:41,000
Hathaya!

189
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,400
Sweetheart?

190
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:44,160
- Where are you?
- She's right here.

191
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:46,040
What are you doing with her?!

192
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,560
Take your daughter.

193
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:50,920
Get out of here and never set foot
in this house again.

194
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,760
Go!

195
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:57,160
Hathaya! Hathaya,
where are you, sweetheart?

196
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:59,960
Go! Go!

197
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:01,360
Come on, sweetheart.

198
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,520
Get out of my life!

199
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,960
Come on. Get in.

200
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,480
Hurry.

201
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:20,360
Mommy, where are you taking me?

202
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:23,520
I'm taking you on a trip.

203
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:25,160
Aren't we bringing Daddy with us?

204
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:31,800
Daddy's over there.

205
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:33,760
- Father!
- Hathai!

206
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:36,400
Are Grandpa and Uncle Thot coming too?

207
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:39,720
Hathai. Don't take my granddaughter away!

208
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,960
- Don't take my granddaughter!
- Father.

209
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,520
Let her out!

210
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,520
Don't take her! Let her go!

211
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,800
Let her go!

212
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:54,560
Father!

213
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:56,200
Father!

214
00:16:57,040 --> 00:17:00,120
Grandpa! Grandpa!

215
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:03,160
Father.

216
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:06,040
You two, go after
my granddaughter right now!

217
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:07,400
- Hurry!
- Yes, Father.

218
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:18,880
Father.

219
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,079
I'm fine.

220
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:23,359
I'm all right.

221
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:30,040
Daddy, where are you going?

222
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,960
I'm going to bring Hathaya back.

223
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:33,760
I'll wait for you, Daddy.

224
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:35,200
I'll be back real soon.

225
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:36,240
Okay.

226
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:46,280
Chayanee, sweetheart. Come here.

227
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:09,120
Mommy, I want to go home.

228
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:12,240
I want to see Grandpa. I want Daddy.

229
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:16,520
Be quiet. And don't mention
any of them again.

230
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:18,320
You're never going to see them again!

231
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,440
I said be quiet!

232
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:41,440
- Is that them?
- Yes.

233
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:11,240
Father!

234
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:14,440
Hathai stole all my jewelry!

235
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,520
That bitch Hathai!

236
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:05,200
She searched the room, found the key,

237
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:08,560
opened the safe, and took the cash

238
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:11,320
and watches.

239
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:14,400
She was already planning to leave.

240
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,440
That damn parasite!

241
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:23,280
<i>You branded me a parasite</i>

242
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,200
<i>who came here to suck you dry
and take your money.</i>

243
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:29,160
<i>Fine. I'll become exactly
what you wanted me to be.</i>

244
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,560
DADDY

245
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:41,200
It's Daddy. I want to talk to him!

246
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:44,800
I told you to sit still!

247
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,560
Hathai won't answer.

248
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:53,680
The more you chase her,
the faster she'll drive.

249
00:20:53,760 --> 00:20:55,080
An accident might happen.

250
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:58,000
Why don't we go back home and wait?
Let Hathai calm down first,

251
00:20:58,080 --> 00:20:59,840
then ask her to give your daughter back.

252
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:02,480
I'm getting my daughter back.

253
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:08,720
Spirits who guard this house,

254
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:10,600
please let Hathai and her daughter

255
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:14,280
die horrible deaths. Don't ever
let them come back here again.

256
00:21:36,960 --> 00:21:39,440
If my prayer comes true,

257
00:21:39,520 --> 00:21:42,480
I'll offer you nine pig heads.

258
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:44,160
<i>Sadhu.</i>

259
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:14,280
Burapha!

260
00:22:45,760 --> 00:22:48,520
Here you go.

261
00:22:49,280 --> 00:22:52,240
Just before Hathai took Hathaya away,

262
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:56,400
someone told me they saw you
leading Hathaya somewhere.

263
00:22:59,520 --> 00:23:00,880
Is that true?

264
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,280
Yes.

265
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:15,800
I found Hathaya
and was going to bring her to you.

266
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:17,600
But Hathaya refused to come with me.

267
00:23:18,280 --> 00:23:19,600
She cried and threw a tantrum,

268
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:21,840
saying she wanted to leave this house.

269
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:27,600
She also said she hated everyone.

270
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:30,080
She said she hated you too.

271
00:23:31,840 --> 00:23:33,600
Hathaya said that?

272
00:23:35,840 --> 00:23:37,720
I raised Miss Hathaya myself.

273
00:23:37,800 --> 00:23:40,240
She isn't rude enough
to say something like that.

274
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:43,120
She loves you very much, sir.

275
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:46,080
Are you accusing me of lying
about my own niece?

276
00:23:47,080 --> 00:23:48,360
Enough.

277
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:53,360
Her mother must have
poisoned her mind against me.

278
00:23:55,600 --> 00:23:56,960
Fine.

279
00:23:57,040 --> 00:24:00,120
If she wants to love her mother
and believe her, then let her go.

280
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,120
Ungrateful little brat.

281
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:06,400
Call Burapha and Thotsaphon back.

282
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,960
No need to go after them anymore.

283
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:12,120
THOTSAPHON

284
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,960
It's Thotsaphon.

285
00:24:17,040 --> 00:24:20,400
Hello? What?

286
00:24:21,520 --> 00:24:22,640
Rescue service?

287
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:27,440
Why do you have my husband's phone?

288
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,400
What happened?

289
00:24:34,520 --> 00:24:35,640
An accident?

290
00:24:37,120 --> 00:24:38,560
They're both dead?!

291
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,280
Thotsaphon!

292
00:24:59,280 --> 00:25:01,320
Chayanee, sweetheart.

293
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:04,520
Your father...

294
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:09,640
Where's Daddy? Daddy said
he was coming back to see me.

295
00:25:10,840 --> 00:25:13,680
Daddy isn't with us anymore, sweetheart.

296
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:23,200
Why did you leave me?

297
00:26:02,360 --> 00:26:03,920
I have no one left.

298
00:26:07,040 --> 00:26:09,520
Both of my sons died because of you two.

299
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:15,360
You're going to pay for this!

300
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:41,360
15 YEARS LATER

301
00:27:04,040 --> 00:27:06,080
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

302
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:08,240
- Enjoy your meal.
- Thanks.

303
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:11,840
MADE TO ORDER FOOD

304
00:27:11,920 --> 00:27:14,720
- Hathaya.
- Yes, Grandma?

305
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:15,840
Hi.

306
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:18,040
- You're back already, sweetheart?
- Let me help.

307
00:27:20,600 --> 00:27:22,920
You just got back from work
and you're already cooking.

308
00:27:23,520 --> 00:27:25,040
Where's your mom?

309
00:27:26,120 --> 00:27:28,000
Mom said she went out to buy something.

310
00:27:28,080 --> 00:27:31,720
But she already asked me to buy
everything. So where has she gone?

311
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:36,120
Boy! You bitch! You vile bitch!

312
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:39,280
Get out! How dare you steal my man?!

313
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:41,880
Get out, you bitch! I'll kill you!

314
00:27:41,960 --> 00:27:43,320
- Mom!
- You bitch!

315
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:45,960
Mom, enough! Aren't you embarrassed?

316
00:27:46,040 --> 00:27:47,640
Why the hell should I be embarrassed?

317
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:49,920
She stole my man. She's the one
who should be ashamed!

318
00:27:51,320 --> 00:27:53,760
Boy! Boy!

319
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:55,360
- Where are you going?
- Let go of me.

320
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:57,040
I'm going home.

321
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:59,080
Boy, don't go.

322
00:27:59,160 --> 00:28:01,160
I've done everything you wanted.

323
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:04,760
But you shouldn't have brought
that woman into my room.

324
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:06,120
So what?

325
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:08,640
I've helped pay the rent
on this house for years.

326
00:28:08,720 --> 00:28:11,080
You've been living off me all this time.
You damn parasites.

327
00:28:11,160 --> 00:28:13,040
- That's not fair.
- Boy.

328
00:28:13,120 --> 00:28:16,120
I earn enough to support my mom
and grandma myself.

329
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:18,400
You were the one
who offered to help with the rent.

330
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:19,760
In return, we kept the house

331
00:28:19,840 --> 00:28:21,080
and cooked for you.

332
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:24,880
You have no right to hold it
over our heads or insult us.

333
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:26,640
I never wanted you to live here.

334
00:28:26,720 --> 00:28:28,360
Fine! Then I won't stay.

335
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:29,920
- No, Boy!
- Let go!

336
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:32,280
- Don't leave me.
- Mom.

337
00:28:32,360 --> 00:28:34,200
Mom, enough!

338
00:28:34,280 --> 00:28:36,920
Aren't you ashamed?

339
00:28:38,200 --> 00:28:41,560
You let people call us parasites
like this and you're not ashamed at all?

340
00:28:41,640 --> 00:28:43,840
Ever since you brought me here,

341
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,880
you gambled away all the money.

342
00:28:46,760 --> 00:28:49,120
You lived off one man after another.

343
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:52,360
I can't take being branded
a parasite anymore.

344
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:58,040
Hey. You're my daughter.
You have no right to lecture me!

345
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:03,800
But I'm your mother,
so I have every right to lecture you.

346
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:05,280
Mom!

347
00:29:05,360 --> 00:29:08,920
- Mom.
- Mom.

348
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:11,400
Mom, enough.

349
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:14,200
You need to learn how to stand
on your own two feet.

350
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:17,080
I invested my salary

351
00:29:17,160 --> 00:29:20,760
so you could run this food stall.
You can survive on this.

352
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:22,600
You don't have to gamble.

353
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:26,440
And what then?
I stand here cooking all day

354
00:29:26,520 --> 00:29:28,560
until my hair and clothes stink?

355
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,560
And how much do I even make in a day?

356
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:34,000
As soon as people saw, they started
copying me and opening their own stalls.

357
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:38,040
Why don't you ever consider
that customers stopped coming

358
00:29:38,120 --> 00:29:39,960
because you don't take it seriously?

359
00:29:40,040 --> 00:29:43,960
You open one day, then close for two
because you run off to gamble.

360
00:29:44,680 --> 00:29:46,600
You have to stop blaming everyone else.

361
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:48,960
Fine!

362
00:29:49,040 --> 00:29:50,240
I'm terrible.

363
00:29:50,320 --> 00:29:54,200
There's nothing good about me. I'm stupid!

364
00:29:54,280 --> 00:29:57,320
Every man I get involved with
accuses me of living off him.

365
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:59,560
And in the end, they all leave me.

366
00:30:01,040 --> 00:30:03,440
Hathai, instead of admitting your mistakes

367
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:05,600
and changing yourself,

368
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:09,520
you deliberately sink even lower,
just like what people say about you.

369
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:12,280
How is your life
ever going to get any better?

370
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:14,240
Mom.

371
00:30:14,320 --> 00:30:18,080
I tried being good before.
It didn't do me any good.

372
00:30:19,120 --> 00:30:20,680
There's no place in this world

373
00:30:20,760 --> 00:30:24,040
for a fool like me.

374
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:37,240
I can't take it anymore.

375
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:41,040
If you don't pay your debt today,

376
00:30:42,280 --> 00:30:43,320
you're dead!

377
00:30:47,120 --> 00:30:48,600
Mom!

378
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,200
Hey! After her!

379
00:31:15,280 --> 00:31:16,240
You're not getting away.

380
00:31:18,160 --> 00:31:19,640
Please.

381
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,560
Give me one more month.

382
00:31:21,640 --> 00:31:24,000
I'll pay everything back,
principal and interest.

383
00:31:24,080 --> 00:31:26,040
How many times have you said that already?

384
00:31:26,120 --> 00:31:28,040
Just the other day,
you were acting tough, saying,

385
00:31:28,120 --> 00:31:30,400
"No money, no running away, no paying."

386
00:31:30,480 --> 00:31:32,720
Please. I'm begging you.

387
00:31:32,800 --> 00:31:35,480
I'll get the money for you tomorrow.
I swear.

388
00:31:35,560 --> 00:31:36,360
Bullshit!

389
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:38,320
Wait!

390
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:40,680
I'll pay you.

391
00:31:43,800 --> 00:31:45,080
She still owes 500,000 baht.

392
00:31:47,760 --> 00:31:49,720
This is really all I have right now.

393
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:52,760
If my mom dies,
you won't get anything at all.

394
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:54,480
You've got one week.

395
00:31:55,520 --> 00:31:56,680
If you don't pay me by then,

396
00:31:57,520 --> 00:31:59,480
start preparing your mom's funeral.

397
00:31:59,560 --> 00:32:01,480
Let's go.

398
00:32:06,040 --> 00:32:07,920
Mom! Are you okay?

399
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:11,120
Are you hurt?

400
00:32:27,760 --> 00:32:28,680
Hathaya.

401
00:32:30,320 --> 00:32:32,440
Please find the money to pay off my debt.

402
00:32:35,360 --> 00:32:37,360
Where am I supposed
to get that kind of money?

403
00:32:38,840 --> 00:32:40,680
That money was my salary.

404
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:45,600
As for my savings,
you gambled it all away.

405
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:50,960
Then go get it from your father's family.

406
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:03,200
What are you talking about?

407
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:11,520
Ever since the day you brought me here,

408
00:33:13,280 --> 00:33:15,200
you told me their house burned down.

409
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:19,720
You said Dad, Grandpa,

410
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:23,920
and everyone in that family died.

411
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,600
Hathai!

412
00:33:27,120 --> 00:33:30,040
You lied to me?
You lied to your own daughter?

413
00:33:32,800 --> 00:33:35,840
I was afraid she'd go looking for them.

414
00:33:35,920 --> 00:33:38,200
And I was afraid they'd call
the police and have me arrested

415
00:33:38,280 --> 00:33:41,520
for stealing their money
and valuables, Mom.

416
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:54,360
You knew how much I missed Dad.

417
00:33:55,600 --> 00:33:56,720
How much I missed Grandpa.

418
00:33:58,680 --> 00:34:00,640
Why would you do this to me?

419
00:34:08,719 --> 00:34:11,080
If you miss them so much,
then go see them.

420
00:34:11,600 --> 00:34:13,840
Go see them.

421
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:15,199
And get their money for me.

422
00:34:15,280 --> 00:34:17,800
Please, Hathaya. Please, sweetheart.

423
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:21,080
Hathaya, don't go.

424
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:22,639
Mom!

425
00:34:22,719 --> 00:34:24,639
Stop using your daughter as a tool.

426
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:28,320
You dragged her away
and made her live a life of hardship.

427
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:30,400
You stole from that family.

428
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:32,960
You really are selfish.

429
00:34:33,040 --> 00:34:36,120
They were right to call you a parasite.
And now you're trying

430
00:34:37,040 --> 00:34:38,800
to send your own daughter back there

431
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:41,400
to be a parasite just like you were.

432
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:43,080
Enough.

433
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:45,560
Take responsibility for once.

434
00:34:46,159 --> 00:34:47,800
So you want to see me die?

435
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:50,280
Then stop gambling and get a job!

436
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:53,239
Where am I supposed to get

437
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:57,280
five hundred thousand to pay them, Mom?
They only gave me one week.

438
00:34:57,840 --> 00:35:00,040
And the reason I gamble

439
00:35:00,120 --> 00:35:02,000
is for you and for Hathaya.

440
00:35:02,080 --> 00:35:05,760
I wanted to win big. I wanted
enough money to take care of both of you.

441
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:08,720
Stop using other people as an excuse.

442
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:11,680
Everything you've done
has been for yourself.

443
00:35:13,040 --> 00:35:16,200
Hathaya, come with Grandma.
Come on, sweetheart.

444
00:35:24,680 --> 00:35:28,680
You're ungrateful!
After everything I've done for you!

445
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:38,080
You really want to see me dead, don't you?

446
00:35:39,320 --> 00:35:42,840
Fine. Then I'll just die.
You can watch me die.

447
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:45,400
Don't give in.

448
00:35:45,480 --> 00:35:48,480
Someone that selfish
would never kill herself.

449
00:35:56,520 --> 00:35:59,000
- Mom.
- Let go.

450
00:35:59,080 --> 00:36:01,000
Please, Mom!

451
00:36:01,080 --> 00:36:04,800
Please stop doing this. I'm begging you.

452
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:08,120
Fine. Then promise me

453
00:36:08,200 --> 00:36:09,320
you'll help me.

454
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:10,880
Promise me!

455
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:13,680
Okay! I promise.

456
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:15,920
I promise I'll help you.

457
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:18,760
But you can't ever do this again.

458
00:36:22,520 --> 00:36:23,800
- Mom!
- Grandma!

459
00:36:27,200 --> 00:36:29,240
Doctor, nurse, please.

460
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:31,880
What's wrong with my grandma?

461
00:36:59,040 --> 00:37:00,200
Hathaya, sweetheart,

462
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:03,080
we need to find money
for Grandma's treatment

463
00:37:03,160 --> 00:37:05,960
before her condition gets worse.

464
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:11,520
Hathaya.

465
00:37:11,600 --> 00:37:15,360
Go back to your father.
Go see Grandpa too.

466
00:37:15,440 --> 00:37:17,600
Ask them for a million.

467
00:37:17,680 --> 00:37:19,520
I'll use some of it to pay off the debt

468
00:37:19,600 --> 00:37:23,200
and the rest for Grandma's treatment.

469
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:31,040
I promise I'll stop gambling.

470
00:37:31,120 --> 00:37:33,600
And I'll stop finding new men.

471
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:36,040
If I'm lying,

472
00:37:36,120 --> 00:37:38,840
may I die within three or seven days.

473
00:37:38,920 --> 00:37:42,120
Please, Hathaya. Go see your father.
Go see Grandpa.

474
00:37:42,200 --> 00:37:45,120
Bring back the money so we can pay
for Grandma's treatment.

475
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:48,480
Grandma.

476
00:37:51,200 --> 00:37:53,920
I'm going back to find Dad and Grandpa.

477
00:37:57,560 --> 00:37:59,560
Please wait for me.

478
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:02,640
I'll get the money to pay
for your treatment.

479
00:38:04,160 --> 00:38:05,320
Good.

480
00:38:06,360 --> 00:38:08,760
Thank you, Hathaya.

481
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:10,520
Thank you, sweetheart.

482
00:38:15,600 --> 00:38:16,840
Mom.

483
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:33,680
Ramil, what are you doing here?

484
00:38:33,760 --> 00:38:37,400
What are you doing here, Mr. Saksit?

485
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:41,120
Don't get smart with me.
I'm not one of your buddies.

486
00:38:41,200 --> 00:38:43,320
Dad and I came to wish
Mr. Pichai a happy birthday.

487
00:38:44,520 --> 00:38:46,440
I brought the workers
to wish him a happy birthday too.

488
00:38:48,240 --> 00:38:51,880
Good grief. Look at the state of them.

489
00:38:52,840 --> 00:38:53,960
You should know better.

490
00:38:54,040 --> 00:38:57,480
Your workers are filthy
and covered in grime.

491
00:38:58,360 --> 00:39:00,720
This event is for important guests only.

492
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:04,160
Take your dirty workers
back to work. Go on.

493
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:08,320
Hello, Chief.

494
00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:12,880
- Hello.
- Hello, Mr. Pichai.

495
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:14,160
Hello.

496
00:39:15,960 --> 00:39:17,440
Mr. Pichai.

497
00:39:18,440 --> 00:39:22,120
This is my son, Raiwin.
He earned his Master's in Business.

498
00:39:22,200 --> 00:39:25,240
I'm planning to send him abroad for
a course in public administration as well.

499
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:29,440
After he comes back, I'll have him run for
subdistrict chief to take over from me.

500
00:39:29,520 --> 00:39:32,880
Then he can work his way up
into national politics.

501
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:34,560
Wow.

502
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:38,440
That's a good plan.
Those are impressive qualifications.

503
00:39:38,520 --> 00:39:40,480
Come back soon
and help your father with his work.

504
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:42,600
At this rate, I may have to start getting

505
00:39:42,680 --> 00:39:45,080
on the good side
of the future chief already.

506
00:39:45,160 --> 00:39:46,760
Oh.

507
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:50,200
I'm the one who should be asking
for your support, Mr. Pichai.

508
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:52,480
I hope people from my generation

509
00:39:52,560 --> 00:39:54,400
can help develop our community.

510
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:57,360
So...

511
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,640
- Shall we go inside?
- Sir.

512
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:02,800
The workers would like
to wish you a happy birthday too.

513
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:05,200
Of course. Thank you.

514
00:40:05,280 --> 00:40:07,160
Thank you, everyone.

515
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:09,360
The flowers are beautiful.

516
00:40:10,680 --> 00:40:12,040
May I take a picture?

517
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:14,800
Of course. Come on, everyone.

518
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:16,920
Come over here.

519
00:40:17,680 --> 00:40:21,000
Chief, and our future chief,

520
00:40:21,080 --> 00:40:22,240
please join us.

521
00:40:26,920 --> 00:40:28,600
One, two...

522
00:40:29,640 --> 00:40:32,320
Chief, give us a smile. Come on, smile.

523
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:37,640
One, two, three.

524
00:40:37,720 --> 00:40:41,600
One, two, three.
Very handsome, Chief. You too, sir.

525
00:40:41,680 --> 00:40:43,920
One, two, three.

526
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:46,960
Chief, look at the camera. Smile, Chief.

527
00:40:47,040 --> 00:40:48,680
Come on. Give us a smile.

528
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:58,360
Father, everything is ready inside.

529
00:40:59,120 --> 00:41:00,240
Please come in.

530
00:41:00,320 --> 00:41:01,880
Let's go.

531
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:03,360
Let's go inside.

532
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:12,960
Wait.

533
00:41:18,200 --> 00:41:20,760
Father's housing development project
is behind schedule.

534
00:41:20,840 --> 00:41:22,000
Get back to work.

535
00:41:22,600 --> 00:41:23,440
Oh!

536
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:24,960
And if there's any food left over,

537
00:41:25,040 --> 00:41:27,200
I'll have someone pack it up
and send it to you.

538
00:41:27,280 --> 00:41:29,000
Now go. Get back to work.

539
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:33,080
Max,

540
00:41:33,160 --> 00:41:36,040
take the workers out for barbecue first,
then head back to the site.

541
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:44,840
Go on.

542
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:47,440
- Come on, guys.
- Let's go.

543
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:49,520
Hey.

544
00:41:50,280 --> 00:41:53,480
You're the foreman.
Shouldn't you be supervising them?

545
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:55,760
Ms. Liu, you don't know about me.

546
00:41:56,680 --> 00:41:58,760
I'm only pretending to be a foreman.

547
00:41:58,840 --> 00:42:01,160
But actually, I'm--

548
00:42:02,560 --> 00:42:05,960
Don't tell me you're secretly
the company president.

549
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:09,480
- No.
- I'm a beggar.

550
00:42:09,560 --> 00:42:12,680
- Spare some money, please.
- You're insane!

551
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:14,080
I'm not your friend.

552
00:42:15,520 --> 00:42:18,560
Father should never
have hired a lunatic like him.

553
00:42:18,640 --> 00:42:22,200
Just wait. One day
I'll throw him out myself.

554
00:42:22,800 --> 00:42:26,480
Madam, would you like me
to drag him back out by the hair?

555
00:42:26,560 --> 00:42:29,120
No. You stay here.

556
00:42:29,200 --> 00:42:32,640
Don't let any low-class people
into the party.

557
00:42:32,720 --> 00:42:33,800
Yes, ma'am.

558
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:40,520
Don't let any low-class people
into the party.

559
00:42:59,040 --> 00:43:01,080
All right, everyone.

560
00:43:03,560 --> 00:43:06,000
Today marks Father's

561
00:43:06,080 --> 00:43:07,960
72nd birthday.

562
00:43:08,040 --> 00:43:11,280
All of us, his children, grandchildren,
family, and dear friends,

563
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:13,080
would like to wish him

564
00:43:13,160 --> 00:43:15,360
the greatest happiness.

565
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:17,840
And now, please enjoy

566
00:43:17,920 --> 00:43:22,040
a very special performance.

567
00:43:22,560 --> 00:43:26,360
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

568
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:30,920
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

569
00:43:31,680 --> 00:43:35,640
<i>Happy birthday, happy birthday</i>

570
00:43:35,720 --> 00:43:39,200
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

571
00:43:40,160 --> 00:43:43,120
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

572
00:43:44,480 --> 00:43:47,600
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

573
00:43:49,200 --> 00:43:50,840
<i>Happy birthday...</i>

574
00:43:59,240 --> 00:44:02,280
<i>Happy birthday</i>

575
00:44:23,720 --> 00:44:25,400
Hey, hey.

576
00:44:26,800 --> 00:44:29,360
Who are you? What are you doing here?

577
00:44:31,600 --> 00:44:33,120
Hmm.

578
00:44:33,200 --> 00:44:35,800
Look at you, dragging a suitcase around.

579
00:44:35,880 --> 00:44:37,880
You obviously weren't invited
to Master's party.

580
00:44:39,160 --> 00:44:41,760
- I'm here to--
- Apply for a job?

581
00:44:41,840 --> 00:44:45,320
Turn around and leave.
We're not hiring maids here.

582
00:44:45,400 --> 00:44:48,120
I'm not here to apply for a job,
Aunt Chamoi.

583
00:44:48,720 --> 00:44:49,560
Oh?

584
00:44:50,080 --> 00:44:53,160
You know my name? Who are you?

585
00:44:54,480 --> 00:44:56,240
Oh.

586
00:44:56,320 --> 00:44:59,160
You're a scammer, aren't you?

587
00:44:59,240 --> 00:45:01,760
You researched me, so you
could come here and con me!

588
00:45:01,840 --> 00:45:04,080
Get out! Go!

589
00:45:04,160 --> 00:45:07,760
Please let me inside. I came
to wish Grandpa a happy birthday.

590
00:45:07,840 --> 00:45:11,280
You know that too?
You really did your research.

591
00:45:11,360 --> 00:45:13,000
You professional little con artist.

592
00:45:13,080 --> 00:45:15,920
Get out of Master Pichai's house
right now.

593
00:45:16,000 --> 00:45:17,160
- Out!
- Please let me inside.

594
00:45:17,240 --> 00:45:19,680
No! Over my dead body

595
00:45:19,760 --> 00:45:21,160
am I letting you in!

596
00:45:27,440 --> 00:45:29,040
Grandpa's little angel

597
00:45:29,120 --> 00:45:32,000
wishes you the most
wonderful birthday ever.

598
00:45:32,680 --> 00:45:35,600
I hope you're very happy
and stay strong and healthy

599
00:45:35,680 --> 00:45:37,920
so you can be with all of us
for a long, long time.

600
00:45:38,000 --> 00:45:39,560
And most importantly,

601
00:45:39,640 --> 00:45:42,360
Grandpa has to love this granddaughter
more than anyone else.

602
00:45:45,160 --> 00:45:46,800
Grandpa only has one granddaughter.

603
00:45:47,560 --> 00:45:49,880
And Chayanee is the granddaughter
I love most.

604
00:45:51,640 --> 00:45:52,600
You're not coming in!

605
00:45:52,680 --> 00:45:54,240
I said you're not coming in!

606
00:45:54,320 --> 00:45:56,640
- I said you can't come in!
- Okay. Fine.

607
00:45:58,640 --> 00:46:00,600
Make a wish, Father.

608
00:46:00,680 --> 00:46:03,080
I don't think I need to wish
for anything anymore.

609
00:46:03,680 --> 00:46:05,200
I have wonderful colleagues

610
00:46:05,280 --> 00:46:07,280
and good friends.

611
00:46:07,880 --> 00:46:11,680
And I wish all of you happiness as well.

612
00:46:12,600 --> 00:46:14,320
Blow out the candles, Grandpa.

613
00:46:17,160 --> 00:46:19,440
You can't go in there!
Come back here right now!

614
00:46:35,240 --> 00:46:36,400
Who are you?

615
00:46:42,200 --> 00:46:44,080
Get up. Come on. Get up.

616
00:46:46,640 --> 00:46:48,000
Have we met before?

617
00:46:49,360 --> 00:46:50,720
Grandpa.

618
00:46:52,640 --> 00:46:53,720
My name is Hathaya.

619
00:47:09,000 --> 00:47:10,320
Hathaya.

620
00:47:11,520 --> 00:47:14,560
I'm Burapha and Hathai's daughter.

621
00:47:17,840 --> 00:47:19,400
Hathaya?

622
00:47:25,880 --> 00:47:27,200
You...

623
00:47:34,880 --> 00:47:36,240
I missed you so much, Grandpa.

624
00:47:36,320 --> 00:47:38,440
I love you more than anyone in the world.

625
00:47:45,680 --> 00:47:46,960
You are not my granddaughter.

626
00:47:51,000 --> 00:47:51,840
Who's that?

627
00:47:54,600 --> 00:47:56,680
I'm Hathaya, Grandpa.

628
00:47:57,520 --> 00:47:59,200
I'm your granddaughter.

629
00:47:59,960 --> 00:48:03,200
My granddaughter died along
with that wicked mother of hers.

630
00:48:04,360 --> 00:48:05,640
They're both dead to me.

631
00:48:11,360 --> 00:48:13,600
I know what my mom did,

632
00:48:14,760 --> 00:48:17,320
and I know how angry you are with her.

633
00:48:18,280 --> 00:48:19,840
But I wanted to come back to you.

634
00:48:20,480 --> 00:48:22,640
Ever since the day
you two left this house,

635
00:48:23,680 --> 00:48:25,560
we considered you dead.

636
00:48:32,360 --> 00:48:34,200
So consider us dead too.

637
00:48:34,280 --> 00:48:36,560
In this life or the next,
I never want to see you.

638
00:48:41,040 --> 00:48:43,280
Get out. Get out!

639
00:48:45,240 --> 00:48:48,640
If you don't want me, that's okay.

640
00:48:49,240 --> 00:48:50,360
I'll leave.

641
00:48:55,440 --> 00:48:56,560
Oh no!

642
00:48:56,640 --> 00:48:58,080
- Grandpa!
- Father!

643
00:48:58,160 --> 00:48:59,440
Father.

644
00:48:59,520 --> 00:49:01,600
- Call an ambulance.
- Grandpa!

645
00:49:12,240 --> 00:49:13,520
<i>You say you love Grandpa.</i>

646
00:49:13,600 --> 00:49:15,240
NEXT EPISODE

647
00:49:15,320 --> 00:49:17,960
Then give him what he wants.

648
00:49:18,840 --> 00:49:20,920
<i>Get out of his life.</i>

649
00:49:21,000 --> 00:49:23,480
<i>What do you really want
by coming back here?</i>

650
00:49:23,560 --> 00:49:26,800
<i>I admit that I'm in trouble, Grandpa.</i>

651
00:49:28,800 --> 00:49:31,280
I'm going to teach her pain and suffering

652
00:49:31,360 --> 00:49:33,320
far worse than anything
her mother ever put me through.

653
00:49:35,000 --> 00:49:36,840
I'm going to make her trust me.

654
00:49:37,440 --> 00:49:40,000
<i>I'll play the part
of the sweet little angel.</i>

655
00:49:40,080 --> 00:49:43,680
And when the time comes,
I'll drag her straight down to hell.

656
00:51:37,920 --> 00:51:39,960
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
